<title>UK: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on 30-year German bund.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on 30-year German bund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said it has issued 30 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the 6.50 percent German government bund due July 2027.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.JUL.97-07.SEP.98   PAYDATE	10.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     SPOT REF     99.73 PCT</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	 ISSUE	 GEARING	PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL	   102 PCT	1.72 DEM    57.98 X	4.00 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	   100 PCT	2.48 DEM    40.21 X	2.76 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	   98 PCT	 3.46 DEM    28.82 X	1.73 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	    100 PCT	6.08 DEM    16.40 X	5.83 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	    98 PCT	 4.95 DEM    20.15 X	6.70 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	    96 PCT	 3.95 DEM    25.25 X	7.70 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
